{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WARNING:</strong> This game contains flashing lights. They can be disabled in the Options menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the infamous<strong><i> Purple Shirt Guy</i></strong>\u00a0known throughout the entire world of Face Invaders, in this HIGH-SPEED-action-packed-score-attack-precision-based arcade game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502530/extras/20250130214603_1.jpg?t=1741051438\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight the most dangerous aliens ever to invade the planet...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502530/extras/202501302146026_1.jpg?t=1741051438\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE FACES!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your strange powers to defeat them, before they overwhelm you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502530/extras/2025013210214606_1.jpg?t=1741051438\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are other watching, and they won't tolerate your actions for long...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is my very first game!</strong>\u00a0Please be nice :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I made this game and all the assets, including the soundtrack, myself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I may update this game in the future with more levels and some bosses too!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502530?t=1741051438","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741051438","capsule_image":"https:/